    "title": "Wilmington man charged with 5th-offense DUI - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WDEL News ,\n5 hours ago A Wilmington man is facing his fifth DUI charge following a traffic stop on Route 13 in the Cheswold area early Wednesday. Delaware State Police said the driver was pulled over after a trooper saw him swerving and traveling at a low rate of speed. The trooper smelled alcohol, and an open bottle of liquor was in plain view on the front passenger seat. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
